OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam tells villagers 'holistic'
OL,4,Aapproach is needed to tackle flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales has said a
OL,7,F"holistic" approach is needed to tackle
OL,8,Fsevere flooding, as a small Welsh
OL,9,Fvillage prepares for the upcoming storm
OL,10,Fseason.
OL,12,FResidents in Skenfrith, Monmouthshire,
OL,13,Fhave faced four major floods in the
OL,14,Fpast six years.
OL,16,FAn extreme flood last winter had a
OL,17,Fdevastating impact on the village, when
OL,18,Fthe River Monnow burst its banks after
OL,19,FStorm Claudia brought a month's worth
OL,20,Fof rain in just 24 hours to parts of
OL,21,FEngland and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
