OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam tells villagers 'holistic'
OL,4,Aapproach is needed to tackle flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince William was visiting the area to
OL,7,Flearn about how communities have been
OL,8,Faffected by recent flooding and what
OL,9,Fmeasures were being taken by local
OL,10,Fauthorities and other agencies to
OL,11,Fmitigate future incidents.
